# The video at the end of the triage guide: jump to the triage zone, open a finished task to read
# its answer, then snooze the task that asked a question so the one waiting for a slot comes in.
# triage-snooze.before starts the tasks and waits out of shot until they settle.
Source recordings/panel.tape
Sleep 2s
Type "t"
Type "j"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+Space
Ctrl+Space
Type "k"
Space
Type "z"
Sleep 3s
